# ─── Never commit: personal data and secrets ──────────────────────────────
# 459 MB of real lecture PDFs, annotations, embeddings, and the card index.
klausmate/user_files/
# Live addon config — holds claude_api_key / embedding_api_key_* once set.
# The glob also covers meta.json.bak-* backups, which `**/meta.json` misses.
klausmate/meta.json*
**/meta.json

